    {
      "id": 100966,
      "title": "Hedge: AI-native specialty insurance company",
      "tagline": "Helping brokers get faster and better coverage for their customers",
      "body": "**TLDR:** We help insurance brokerages get quotes faster and cheaper. We started as brokers, realized insurance is broken end to end, and are now building the plumbing to fix it.\n\nWe’re hiring across sales, ops, and engineering here in SF. [**Apply here**](https://www.workatastartup.com/companies/hedge)**.** \n\n### **The problem:**\n\nI started a YC-backed AI-native insurance brokerage because buying insurance sucked.\n\nWe thought the answer was building a better brokerage. But then we became brokers and realized we weren’t actually fixing the system.\n\nBrokers do important work. They help businesses navigate a messy market. But they don’t control the parts of the stack that determine speed, price, and coverage.\n\nEvery quote still depends on multiple layers of brokers, underwriters, carriers, reinsurers, MGAs, and wholesalers.\n\nEach layer is still manual. Someone re-enters the same information by hand, then emails it to another person in the chain who does the same.\n\nEven when brokers move fast, quotes still sometimes take days or weeks. Brokers hate this. Their customers hate it even more.\n\nWe realized the only way to fix this was to go full stack and rebuild the workflows ourselves.\n\n### **What we’re building:**\n\n[**Hedge**](https://www.hedgespecialty.com) helps insurance brokerages get better, faster, and cheaper coverage for complex businesses.\n\nTo do this, we’re starting with the wholesale layer. The first major bottleneck for brokers.\n\nOur competitors are billion-dollar businesses that are still almost entirely human-driven. Ryan Specialty, one of the largest wholesalers, spends almost 60% of revenue on salaries. Their version of innovation is giving manual work to offshore contractors.\n\nWe think the better version is rebuilding the workflow around AI from day one. Hedge uses AI agents paired with underwriting to help brokers get quotes faster.\n\nSoon, we’re moving up the stack: combining wholesale distribution and underwriting into one AI-native insurance company built to help brokers win more business.\n\n### **Let’s talk!**\n\nWe’re already working with some of the fastest-growing brokerages we know, and now we’re scaling as fast as possible.\n\nIf you place E&amp;S business and want faster, cheaper quotes for your clients, we’d love to work with you.\\\n\\\nTo learn more:[ hedgespecialty.com](https://www.hedgespecialty.com/)\\\n\\\n**We’re hiring!  [Apply here](https://www.hedgespecialty.com/careers)**\n\n![uploaded image](/media/?type=post&id=100966&key=user_uploads/2567632/24c6880c-1e40-4812-a0b5-ada49876f9db)\n\n",
      "url": "https://www.ycombinator.com/launches/QGU-hedge-ai-native-specialty-insurance-company",
